# The generated soc/Kconfig sources the files at this level only; the series
# directory is reached from here. Removing this line is not cosmetic: the
# configuration then fails while the SoC series is resolved.

# Not wrapped in "if SOC_FAMILY_BEKEN_ARM": the series selects the family, so
# the family condition would make the two symbols depend on each other and
# kconfig would report a dependency loop.
rsource "*/Kconfig"
